"Li fonccion SECONDS() ritoûne li valixhance des segondes d' ene ratourneure "
"di tins."

#: functions/datetime.xml:480
msgid "SECONDS(time)"
msgstr "SECONDS(eure)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:481
msgid "SECONDS(\"10:5:2\") returns 2"
msgstr "SECONDS(\"10:5:2\") ritoûne 2"

#: functions/datetime.xml:489
msgid "Number of day in week (1..7)"
msgstr "Nombe di djoûs d' ene samwinne (1..7)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:493
msgid ""
"The DAYNAME() function returns the name of the day of the week (1..7). In "
"some countries the first day of the week is Monday, while in others the "
"first day of the week is Sunday."
msgstr ""
"Li fonccion DAYNAME() ritoûne li no do djoû del samwinne (1..7). I gn a des "
"payis ewou çk el prumî djoû del samwinne est l' londi dabôrd ki dins ds ôtes "
"c' est l' dimegne."

#: functions/datetime.xml:494
msgid "DAYNAME(weekday)"
msgstr "DAYNAME(djoû del samwinne)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:495
msgid "DAYNAME(1) returns Monday (if the week starts on Monday)"
msgstr "DAYNAME(1) ritoûne londi (sel samwinne atake li londi)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:504
msgid "Number of month (1..12)"
msgstr "Nombe di moes (1..12)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:508
msgid "The MONTHNAME() function returns the name of the month (1...12)."
msgstr "Li fonccion MONTHNAME() ritoûne li no do moes (1..12)."

#: functions/datetime.xml:509
msgid "MONTHNAME(number)"
msgstr "MONTHNAME(limero)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:510
msgid "MONTHNAME(5) returns May"
msgstr "MONTHNAME(5) ritoûne May"

#: functions/datetime.xml:518
msgid ""
"The CURRENTDATE() function returns the current date. It is equivalent to the "
"TODAY function."
msgstr ""
"Li fonccion CURRENTDATE() ritoûne li date d' ådjourdu. C' est l' minme kel "
"fonccion TODAY."

#: functions/datetime.xml:519
msgid "CURRENTDATE()"
msgstr "CURRENTDATE()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:520
msgid "CURRENTDATE() returns \"Saturday 13 April 2002\""
msgstr "CURRENTDATE() ritoûne \"Semdi li 13 d' Avri 2002\""

#: functions/datetime.xml:530
msgid "The TODAY() function returns the current date."
msgstr "L"

#: functions/datetime.xml:531
msgid "TODAY()"
msgstr "TODAY()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:532
msgid "TODAY() returns \"Saturday 13 April 2002\""
msgstr "TODAY() returns \"Semdi li 13 d' Avri 2002\""

#: functions/datetime.xml:542
msgid ""
"The NOW() function returns the current date and time. It is identical with "
"CURRENTDATETIME and provided for compatibility with other applications."
msgstr ""
"Li fonccion NOW() ritoûne li date eyet l' eure do moumint. C' est l' minme "
"k' avou CURRENTDATETIME mins c' est dné pos esse copatibe avou d' ôtes "
"programes."

#: functions/datetime.xml:543
msgid "NOW()"
msgstr "NOW()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:544
msgid "NOW() returns \"Saturday 13 April 2002 19:12:01\""
msgstr "NOW() returns \"Semdi 13 d' Avri 2002 19:12:01\""

#: functions/datetime.xml:554
msgid "The CURRENTDATETIME() function returns the current date and time."
msgstr "Li fonccion CURRENTDATETIME() ritoûne li date eyet l' eure do moumint."

#: functions/datetime.xml:555
msgid "CURRENTDATETIME()"
msgstr "CURRENTDATETIME()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:556
msgid "CURRENTDATETIME() returns \"Saturday 13 April 2002 19:12:01\""
msgstr "CURRENTDATETIME() returns \"Semdi 13 d' Avri 2002 19:12:01\""

#: functions/datetime.xml:564
msgid ""
"The CURRENTTIME() function returns the current time formatted with local "
